nContainer 'app' OOM Kill (exitCode=137, 96Mi limit) \n  → \nContainer failed to terminate cleanly (Error state) \n  → \nPod deletion blocked by pending finalizer (未直接观测到 finalizer 对象，但属 Terminating 状态卡住的典型阻塞机制) \n  → \nPod aiops-case-11/workload stuck in Terminating state with phase Running\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因**：Pod `aiops-case-11/workload` 因容器内存受限（96Mi）触发 OOM Kill（退出码 137），导致容器异常终止。\n\n**阻塞机制**：Pod 进入 Terminating 状态后未能自动清理，保持 Running Phase 和 ContainersNotReady 状态（证据 #1, #2, #4, #8）。这与正式 RCA 推断的 `aiops.lab/hold` finalizer 阻塞一致——即 Kubelet 或控制器因容器异常退出（Error state）或 finalizer 机制而停止后续删除操作。\n\n**证据不足**：\n1.  **OOM 具体原因**：日志（#5）中 `allocated_mib` 始终为 0，缺乏内存增长趋势数据（Metric 无多样本趋势），无法区分是内存泄漏还是瞬时峰值。\n2.  **Finalizer 状态**：事实列表中未直接包含 Pod 的 Finalizer 字段或 `aiops.lab/hold` 关联 Controller 的状态，RCA 中的 Finalizer 阻塞为合理推断，但缺乏直接的对象状态证据。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 20.6s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 38.2s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-11/workload: 38.2s (Evidence 28.9s, RCA 9.1s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 15.6s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-11/workload**: pod-terminating-stuck\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 74.404, "metrics": {"run_id": "64c9abd2d67d4007", "mttr": {"value": "1.2m", "seconds": 74.41133141517639, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-terminating-stuck", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name"